          "text": "`judge-jev check --profile <profile>` MUST report each pair's verdict."
        },
        {
          "modal": "Must",
          "text": "`judge-jev check --profile <profile>` MUST aggregate the verdicts per\nrecord."
        },
        {
          "modal": "Must",
          "text": "`judge-jev check --profile <profile>` MUST aggregate the verdicts per\nlocation."
        },
        {
